# Instructions:
# 1. Create a file named .env in your root directory (same level as package.json)
# 2. Copy the content above into the .env file
# 3. Replace the placeholder values with your actual API keys
# 4. Restart your development server
# 5. The chatbot will automatically detect and use the available API keys

# Example with real keys (DO NOT COMMIT THIS FILE WITH REAL KEYS):
# VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSyB1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890

